enile polyposis syndrome. Human ortholog(s) of this gene implicated in several diseases, including bone disease (multiple); cleft lip; congenital anomalies of kidney and urinary tract (multiple); hemochromatosis type 1; and orofacial cleft 11. Orthologous to human BMP2 (bone morphogenetic protein 2) and BMP4 (bone morphogenetic protein 4). [provided by Alliance of Genome Resources, Jun 2026]"}], "gene_ontology": {"assigned_by": "FlyBase", "molecular_functions": [{"name": "BMP receptor binding", "go_id": "GO:0070700", "evidence_code": "IPI", "qualifier": "enables", "reference": {"pmids": ["8044838"]}}, {"name": "collagen binding", "go_id": "GO:0005518", "evidence_code": "IDA", "qualifier": "enables", "reference": {"pmids": ["22733779"]}}, {"name": "cytokine activity", "go_id": "GO:0005125", "evidence_code": "IBA", "qualifier": "enables"}, {"name": "growth factor activity", "go_id": "GO:0008083", "evidence_code": "IEA", "qualifier": "enables"}, {"name": "heparin binding", "go_id": "GO:0008201", "evidence_code": "IDA", "qualifier": "enables", "reference": {"pmids": ["19433798"]}}, {"name": "morphogen activity", "go_id": "GO:0016015", "evidence_code": "IDA", "qualifier": "enables", "reference": {"pmids": ["38265865"]}}, {"name": "morphogen activity", "go_id": "GO:0016015", "evidence_code": "IGI", "qualifier": "enables", "reference": {"pmids": ["12620978"]}}, {"name": "morphogen activity", "go_id": "GO:0016015", "evidence_code": "IMP", "qualifier": "enables", "reference": {"pmids": ["8330541", "8616891", "37054707"]}}, {"name": "protein binding", "go_id": "GO:0005515", "evidence_code": "IPI", "qualifier": "enables", "reference": {"pmids": ["17055473", "18701888"]}}, {"name": "protein heterodimerization activity", "go_id": "GO:0046982", "evidence_code": "IPI", "qualifier": "enables", "reference": {"pmids": ["15797386", "24560644", "28924042"]}}, {"name": "protein homodimerization activity", "go_id": "GO:0042803", "evidence_code": "IDA", "qualifier": "enables", "reference"